# Colossal Clone Master copies a 2/1 Phyrexian Horror token (CR 707.2): the copy acquires the token's copiable values and
# the exception's characteristic-defining ability (CR 707.9a), so with its one differently named land its P/T is 1/1 while
# the copied token is 2/1. It keeps the copied haste and trample, and being a token is not copied, so the copy is not one.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Urabrask's Forge
Black Lotus
Black Lotus
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Colossal Clone Master
Forest
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus#1.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Urabrask's Forge.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Phyrexian Horror Token.Power = 2
? Bot1.Battlefield.Phyrexian Horror Token.Toughness = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus#1.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Colossal Clone Master.Cast
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Phyrexian Horror Token#2.Power = 1
? Bot1.Battlefield.Phyrexian Horror Token#2.Toughness = 1

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Phyrexian Horror Token#1.Power = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Phyrexian Horror Token#1.Toughness = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Phyrexian Horror Token#1.Token = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Phyrexian Horror Token#1.Keywords = Haste; Trample
Bot1.Battlefield.Phyrexian Horror Token#2.Power = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Phyrexian Horror Token#2.Toughness = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Phyrexian Horror Token#2.Token = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Phyrexian Horror Token#2.Keywords = Haste; Trample
